# Skills

Skills live in `.claude/skills/<name>/SKILL.md` and are invoked as `/<name>`.

| Skill | Usage | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| `ansible-bootstrap` | `/ansible-bootstrap <dir>` | Scaffolds a hardened Ansible project (Debian/Ubuntu + RHEL 9): `common`, `users`, `ssh`, `firewall`, `fail2ban` roles, vault, lint config. Never overwrites. Preloaded by the `ansible-expert` agent. |
